*.pem
*.pyc
__pycache__/
# Requests in flight between the web side and the camera side: someone is
# looking, re-find the phone, read this box. All three exist for seconds and
# live in /dev/shm on any machine that has it — see rpi/handoff.py. These are
# the fallback names, used where there is no RAM disk to write in, and still
# read on either machine so an upgrade cannot drop a request between the two
# sides restarting.
rpi/.viewing
rpi/.viewing.part
rpi/.recalibrate
rpi/.cropbox.json
rpi/.cropbox.json.part
rpi/config-preview.png
rpi/config.json
rpi/live-frame.jpg
ssl/

# A shift's worth of offers: what was paid, how far, and when. That is the
# driver's own earnings history and, by the hour, where they were. It stays on
# the Pi, like the calibration and the live frame.
rpi/journal.jsonl
rpi/journal.jsonl.*
